  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fill spans: long single-byte runs (zeros in disk images, 0xFF in flash dumps) are recorded in the index and served without touching the decoder - reads over empty space become ~free, and ZstdIndex.FillSpans exposes them as sparse-extent metadata. New ZSTZRAN3 typed-record index format (ZSTZRAN1/2 files still load).",
